F:   xml:123820 <spirit:description>The 10G/25G Ethernet Subsystem provides a 10G or 25G Ethernet MAC and PCS/PMA, or standalone PCS/PMA, in BASE-R or BASE-KR modes. The core is designed to the 25G Ethernet Consortium Specification revision 1.4 (August 28, 2014) of the Consortium and the IEEE Draft P802.3by/D0.1 10th February 2015 standard. The transmit and receive data interface uses the AXI4-Streaming interfaces. An optional AXI4-Lite interface is used to access the control and status registers. The standalone BASE-R configuration is available at no charge without any additional license key. Configurations that require the Ethernet MAC or BASE-KR options are license fee based. For more information, please visit the 10G/25G Ethernet product page.</spirit:description>
